prg-viewer
==========

This plugin reads files in the PRG container format produced by Project Graph
(https://graphif.dev, https://github.com/graphif/project-graph).

Project Graph is licensed under GPL-3.0. This project is an independent
implementation: it was written from the public PRG file format specification
(https://graphif.dev/docs/spec/prg), the public serializer specification
(https://graphif.dev/docs/spec/serializer) and black-box observation of files
produced by the application. No source code of Project Graph is copied or
linked into this project.

The visual conventions implemented here (font scale, node padding, border
width, corner radius, line-height, edge anchoring and curve bending) are
descriptive constants required for visual compatibility with files authored in
the application.
